<title>BRAZIL: Brazil IBGE sees 78.93 mln tonnes grains/oilseeds.</title>
<headline>Brazil IBGE sees 78.93 mln tonnes grains/oilseeds.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian 1997 production of grains and oilseeds could reach 78.93 million tonnes, 8.10 percent up from the 73.02 million tonnes produced in 1996, said the National Statistics Institute (IBGE) in a statement.</p>
<p>This estimate however is based on some simulations, principally for winter crops such as wheat and for second and third crops of some products, it added.</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
